---
title: Tree-Shaking
id: tree-shaking
order: 7
description: "TanStack AI's tree-shakeable architecture — import only the activities and adapters you use for minimal bundle size across chat, image, and speech."
keywords:
  - tanstack ai
  - tree-shaking
  - bundle size
  - modular imports
  - performance
  - tree-shakeable
